Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.99,0:08:29.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}就是咖喱{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Curry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.49,0:08:31.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}唔{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Mm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.62,0:08:36.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我觉得很棒，真的{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I think they're great. I really do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.91,0:08:37.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}还记得路格温家吧？{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You remember the Lugwins?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.08,0:08:39.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}大女儿曾暗恋你，对吧？{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}The big one had a thing for you, didn't she?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.17,0:08:41.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}她们都暗恋他{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}They all had a thing for him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.79,0:08:43.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}妈{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh, Mom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.09,0:08:46.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}对不起 这个女孩为什么要打电话给我？{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I'm sorry. Why is this girl going to call me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.38,0:08:50.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}她刚毕业 想在餐饮界或食品界做事{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh, she just graduated, and she wants to be something in cooking or food...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.09,0:08:52.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我不知道{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...or I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.43,0:08:54.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}总之我跟她说你开了一家餐厅{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Anyway, I told her you had a restaurant, so...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.01,0:08:57.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}不，妈，我没有开餐厅 我在餐厅里工作{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}No, Mom. I don't have a restaurant. I work in a restaurant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.89,0:09:00.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}他们不必知道那么多{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Well, they don't have to know that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.81,0:09:06.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}罗斯，麻烦你过来帮我弄意大利面{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Ross, could you come and help me with the spaghetti.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.32,0:09:07.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}好的{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.48,0:09:09.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我们要吃意大利面，那真是…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh, we're having spaghetti. That's...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.95,0:09:11.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}太轻松了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.41,0:09:16.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我知道听起来我真的很自私{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I know this is going to sound unbelievably selfish on my part...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.70,0:09:19.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你打算提起宝宝跟女同志的事吗？{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...but were you planning on bringing up the whole babylesbian thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.12,0:09:22.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我想那能帮我挡些子弹{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Because I think it might take some of the heat off me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.96,0:09:29.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}瑞秋打算怎么过生活？ 我们在俱乐部遇到她爸妈{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}What that Rachel did to her life. We ran into her parents at the club.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.01,0:09:31.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}他们似乎很难过{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}They were not playing very well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.18,0:09:34.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我不想告诉你们 他们花了多少钱办婚礼{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I'm not gonna tell you what they spent on that wedding...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.80,0:09:37.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}但四万块是一大笔钱{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...but $40,000 is a lot of money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.14,0:09:43.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}至少她有机会在婚礼上甩了男人{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Well, at least she had the chance to leave a man at the altar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.98,0:09:49.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}- 那是什么意思？ - 没事{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}- What's that supposed to mean? - Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.94,0:09:53.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}- 那只是一种说法 - 不，不是的{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}- It's an expression. - No, it's not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.45,0:09:54.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}别听你妈的{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Don't listen to your mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.82,0:09:56.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你很独立 你一直都是如此{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You're independent and you always have been.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.99,0:09:59.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}即使你小时候胖嘟嘟的{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Even when you were a kid, and you were chubby...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.66,0:10:02.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}没有朋友，你还是过得很好{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...and you had no friends, you were just fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.29,0:10:07.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你一个人在房里看书玩拼图{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You'd read alone in your room. And your puzzles...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.96,0:10:14.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}听着，像罗斯这样的人 必须追求成功{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Look, there are people, like Ross, who need to shoot for the stars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.14,0:10:17.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}他到博物馆工作，准备出版论文{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}With his museum and his papers getting published.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.18,0:10:20.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}其他人则是安于现状{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Other people are satisfied with staying where they are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.64,0:10:24.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我要说的是这些人永远不会得癌症{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I'm telling you, these are the people who never get cancer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.23,0:10:31.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我看到报道说这些女人想那么做 谢天谢地{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}And I read about these women trying to have it all, and I thank God...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.57,0:10:34.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我们的小摩妮卡没有那样的问题{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...our little Harmonica doesn't seem to have that problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.28,0:10:39.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}罗斯，你还好吗？{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}So, Ross, what's going on with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.04,0:10:45.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}有任何故事吗？ 没有消息或趣事要跟父母分享？{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Any stories? No news, no little anecdotes to share with the folks?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.33,0:10:46.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}好吧{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Okay, okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.42,0:10:53.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}听着，我知道你们一直很好奇{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Ahem. Look, I, uh... I realize you guys have been wondering...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.38,0:10:56.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我跟卡萝到底是怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...what exactly happened between Carol and me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.22,0:10:58.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}情况是这样的{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}And so, well, here's the deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.06,0:11:02.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}卡萝是女同志{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Carol's a lesbian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.77,0:11:07.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}她跟一个叫苏珊的女人住在一起{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}She's living with a woman named Susan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.98,0:11:12.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}她怀了我的孩子{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}She's pregnant with my child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.61,0:11:15.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}她跟苏珊要一起抚养孩子{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}And she and Susan are going to raise the baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.83,0:11:21.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你早就知道了？{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}And you knew about this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.75,0:11:33.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}（中央咖啡厅）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.05,0:11:37.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你们的爸妈真的有那么难过？{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Your folks are really that bad, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.93,0:11:41.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}他们可是专家{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Well, you know, these people are pros.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.77,0:11:46.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}他们知道自己在做什么 愿意花时间{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}They know what they're doing. They take their time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.52,0:11:49.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}不做完誓不甘休{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}They get the job done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.98,0:11:54.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}天啊，我知道俗话说 人是无法换父母的{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Boy, I know they say that you can't change your parents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.36,0:11:57.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}天啊，如果可以的话 我想跟你换父母{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Boy, if you could, I'd want yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.45,0:12:01.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我得去尿尿{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Must pee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.16,0:12:03.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}这比你们是双胞胎还糟糕{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You know, it's even worse when you're twins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.12,0:12:06.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}- 你是双胞胎？ - 对，我们不说话{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}- You're a twin? - Oh, yeah. We don't speak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.50,0:12:09.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}她是位高权重的霸道女强人{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}She's like this high-powered, driven, career-type.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.62,0:12:11.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}- 她做什么样的工作？ - 她是服务生{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}- What does she do? - She's a waitress.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.71,0:12:16.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}好了，各位，我必须打扫{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}All right. You guys, I kind of gotta clean up now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.88,0:12:19.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}钱德，你是独生子 你不必忍受这一切{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Chandler, you're an only child, right? You don't have any of this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.97,0:12:23.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}不，但我有个幻想的朋友{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Well, no, although I did have an imaginary friend...{\r}
